	(text_box "- Cut the board to the analog path for bench bring-up: HV input, clamp, buffer, Howland pump, limiter, PhotoMOS, TVS, read-back.\n\n- Removed the trips, latch, power-on reset, rail monitors, enable logic and parking switch (kept in simulation for Rev 2).\n\n- Changed rail shunts RSP/RSN to 10 Ohm for current measurement.\n\n- Changed FPGA connector J3 to DAC_CMD, ENABLE, I_RETURN_ADC, V_ELEC_ADC, VMID_REF and grounds; no power.\n\n- Added the read-back stage (OPA4192) for the FPGA ADC.\n\n- Added bench bias jumpers JP1/JP2, current-loop header JP3, 29 test loops and M3 mounting holes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 40.64 0)
		(size 58.42 111.76)
