	(text_box "- Captured the full Rev 1 channel from the simulated netlist and the P4 BoM: 14 sheets, 156 parts.\n\n- Included the full safety chain: over-current and mismatch trips, fault latch, power-on reset, rail monitors, parking switch.\n\n- Netlist matched expected_netlist.csv with 0 differences; ERC clean."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 40.64 0)
		(size 58.42 149.86)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.905 1.905)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad6691dd-2a78-4ce5-872d-4ceee09011c1")
	)
	(text_box "- Reduced the low-voltage input to one +12 V (J2, 2-pin screw terminal); U32 isolated DC-DC makes +/-12 V on board.\n\n- Removed +5 V; LM4040 bias R50 now from +9 V (5.1k).\n\n- Changed U1 and U3 from OPA171 to OPA192: output accuracy passes without the zero calibration.\n\n- Added red LEDs: PWR (D8), HV LIVE (D7) and OUT EN (D6, in the PhotoMOS LED string; RLED1 now 750 Ohm).\n\n- Fixed the AQY214S symbol (its pins were hidden).\n\n- Resized passives: 0603 by default; 0805/1206/2512 only where voltage, power or precision needs it; one part per value.\n\n- Wired the top sheet; ERC clean; page numbers now follow the sheet titles.\n\n- Formatted after the FoC Motor Controller and AMULET: cover index, block frames with captions, this page. PCB text in JetBrains Mono; 3D model for every part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
